{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29227","headline":"登蒜山观发军 · 许浑","name":"登蒜山观发军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽檄徵兵急，辕门选将雄。\n犬羊忧破竹，貔虎极飞蓬。\n定系猖狂虏，何烦矍铄翁。\n更探黄石略，重振黑山功。\n别马嘶营柳，惊乌散井桐。\n低星连宝剑，残月让雕弓。\n浪晓戈鋋里，山晴鼓角中。\n甲开鱼照水，旗扬虎拏风。\n去想金河远，行知玉塞空。\n汉庭应有问，师律在元戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}